<title>USA: Alta Gold reserves exceed 1.0 mln ounces.</title>
<headline>Alta Gold reserves exceed 1.0 mln ounces.</headline>
<dateline>HENDERSON, Nev. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alta Gold Co said Thursday its proven and probable mineable reserves contained 1,045,074 ounces of gold at year-end 1996, up 34 percent from a year earlier.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
